{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/84785c4da5d7220a503a2ecfafe0a08090047ff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,D,E,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in the figure below represents a different digit from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de3ed5fb7fa9b1fa73395d65c43e5bc81cd9d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> Each of the five lines shown passes through some of these points. The digits along each line are added to produce five sums, one for each line. The total of the five sums is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/d/c8d06fc910703a003655e44dbcd4f3626ee6d02f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> What is the digit represented by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d3713b61d71855f44ce52196d5bf838501d09ad5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B?$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/7/d878779f0718f46b33d37199ff7b7df96df2948e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); dotfactor = 10;  pair p1 = (-28,0); pair p2 = (-111,213); draw(p1--p2,linewidth(1));  pair p3 = (-160,0); pair p4 = (-244,213); draw(p3--p4,linewidth(1));  pair p5 = (-316,0); pair p6 = (-67,213); draw(p5--p6,linewidth(1));  pair p7 = (0, 68); pair p8 = (-350,10); draw(p7--p8,linewidth(1));  pair p9 = (0, 150); pair p10 = (-350, 62); draw(p9--p10,linewidth(1));  pair A = intersectionpoint(p1--p2, p5--p6); dot(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, 2*W);  pair B = intersectionpoint(p5--p6, p3--p4); dot(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, 2*WNW);  pair C = intersectionpoint(p7--p8, p5--p6); dot(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, 1.5*NW);  pair D = intersectionpoint(p3--p4, p7--p8); dot(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, 2*NNE);  pair EE = intersectionpoint(p1--p2, p7--p8); dot(&quot;$E$&quot;, EE, 2*NNE);  pair F = intersectionpoint(p1--p2, p9--p10); dot(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, 2*NNE); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"205\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b26b558fdb444715fcf411132081235bd3a230a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can form the following expressions for the sum along each line:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced75e75ee703776845d4ca9666de8729ada010b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{dcases}A+B+C\\\\A+E+F\\\\C+D+E\\\\B+D\\\\B+F\\end{dcases}\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"117\" />\nAdding these together, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b717c3ca6751b71285ac8cfa32798c9e6ba72088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2A+3B+2C+2D+2E+2F=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"295\" height=\"14\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25ab19f632672aa59bb62ca53554d2768abd9480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(A+B+C+D+E+F)+B=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"300\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/f/68f8ba678233e72086c97ee6c18b0943502aac82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A,B,C,D,E,F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"126\" height=\"16\" /> are unique integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/a/21a7481325adbf19d9a248e194e13409dd37caac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C+D+E+F=1+2+3+4+5+6=21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"429\" height=\"14\" /> (where the order doesn't matter as addition is commutative), so our equation simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75916d676884c838b9ae522eae14aa67d38090c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42 + B = 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"14\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2df1dec36a15789860875e9de8257325e9590431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"93\" height=\"28\" />.\n~RJ5303707\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following the first few steps of Solution 1, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1de2dbac883b44288d12080426ce6ca29d5751c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(A+C+D+E+F)+3B=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"272\" height=\"18\" />.      Because an even number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/5566ab7d41e0ecb1291ea208403864cf5086554c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(A+C+D+E+F)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" /> subtracted from an odd number (47) is always odd, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/9/cb93b9dbd8a783496111be0f383d889cf5aebfb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3B$\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> is odd, showing that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is odd. Now we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is 1, 3, or 5. If we try <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/c/a5c03a46be6376bc33248033059e2c1dddd6adbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/2/17269c7540c99c153bd8fb51600ca61cc8f4dab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$43=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, which is not true. Also when we test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67c2c9486777b4b59b7f5cf1af4476b219edeff4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=3$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d5d95a9ad117833b62a14c5258059e8522f689c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45=47$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, which is also false. Therefore, we end up getting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2df1dec36a15789860875e9de8257325e9590431.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"93\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-minor edit by tonykuncheng\n</p><p>-minor edit by Lebron James\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bHNrBwwUCMI</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=n-vOSvxYPmuhVmaq&amp;t=2574\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=n-vOSvxYPmuhVmaq&amp;t=2574</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CLEVER_MANIPULATIONS!!!)\">Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CLEVER MANIPULATIONS!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/W8pib6O_6xA\">https://youtu.be/W8pib6O_6xA</a>\n</p><p>~<i>Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwCb64F34XE\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwCb64F34XE</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1ldTmo4J7Es\">https://youtu.be/1ldTmo4J7Es</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3Z7zEc7AXQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3Z7zEc7AXQ</a>\n-LOUISGENIUS\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=728\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=728</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"ht